OL,3,GNEWSAHeavenly Creatures killer Pauline
OL,4,AParker dies in Orkney, aged 88
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo her neighbours and friends, Hilary
OL,7,FNathan was a quiet, religious woman who
OL,8,Fran a riding stable in the small
OL,9,FOrcadian island of Burray.
OL,11,FBut her death in an island care home
OL,12,Flast week at the age of 88 closes a
OL,13,Fchapter on an extraordinary life that
OL,14,Fbegan 70 years ago on the other side of
OL,15,Fthe world with a sensational murder
OL,16,Ftrial.
OL,18,FAs a 16-year-old and under her birth
OL,19,Fname of Pauline Parker, she was
OL,20,Fconvicted alongside her schoolfriend
OL,21,FJuliet Hulme of the murder of her
OL,22,Fmother Honora Parker.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
